OL,3,AKing to open Commonwealth summit as
OL,4,ABurnham begins talks on slavery apology
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs part of talks with fellow leaders,
OL,7,FBurnham is expected to set out plans
OL,8,Ffor a "debt reset" to support
OL,9,FCommonwealth countries dealing with the
OL,10,Fgrowing cost of paying interest
OL,12,FThe Commonwealth leaders' summit is
OL,13,Fheld every two years and allows leaders
OL,14,Fand representatives of the 56 nations
OL,15,Fto discuss the future of the
OL,16,Fpartnership
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
