OL,3,AFour flights targeted by suspected bomb
OL,4,Athreats land at European airports
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour flights have landed at European
OL,7,Fairports after being targeted by
OL,8,Fsuspected bomb threats
OL,10,FTwo flights were inspected in Warsaw,
OL,11,Fincluding one that had set off from
OL,12,FLondon Heathrow
OL,14,FAnother plane that departed Manchester
OL,15,Fwas inspected in Murcia in Spain, while
OL,16,Flocal media in Bulgaria reports a plane
OL,17,Flanding in capital Sofia after a threat
OL,19,FThe incidents come a day after a flight
OL,20,Ffrom London Luton to Sofia made an
OL,21,Femergency landing in Budapest,
OL,22,Ffollowing a bomb threat
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
